  <ferc:TypeOfOrganizationIfNotIncorporated id="Tag2269" contextRef="C1">El Paso Natural Gas Company, L.L.C. (EPNG) was originally organized as a Delaware corporation on November 18, 1928, EPNG was converted to a Delaware limited liability company on August 6, 2012.</ferc:TypeOfOrganizationIfNotIncorporated>
  <ferc:GeneralInformationAboutStatesInWhichRespondentServicesWereRendered id="Tag2270" contextRef="C1">Respondent is a natural gas pipeline company primarily engaged in open-access interstate transportation and storage of natural gas. Respondent's interstate pipeline system extends from the Permian Basin area of West Texas and Southeast New Mexico, the Texas-Oklahoma Panhandle area, the Anadarko Basin of Southwest Oklahoma, and the San Juan Basin of Northwest New Mexico and Southwest Colorado through one or more of the states of Texas, Oklahoma, New Mexico, Colorado, Arizona, and California, as well as to points of termination at the boundary between the United States and Mexico in both Arizona and Texas.</ferc:GeneralInformationAboutStatesInWhichRespondentServicesWereRendered>
  <ferc:GeneralInformationChangeInAuditorFlag id="Tag2271" contextRef="C1">false</ferc:GeneralInformationChangeInAuditorFlag>
