&lt;p style="margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 14pt; text-align: justify;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;(1) The composite weighted average depreciation rate for each of the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024 was approximately 2.4%.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
