&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Rental expense on our rights-of-way for the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024 was approximately $37 million and $36 million, respectively, and is reflected in Account 401 "Operation Expenses" on our income statements.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;Transportation Commitments.&amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;We have entered into transportation contracts with our affiliates, Mojave and TransColorado&amp;#160;Gas Transmission&amp;#160;Company LLC, with commitments totaling $106 million extending through March 2031. Our future annual obligations as of December 31, 2025 are $29 million for 2026, $26 million for each of the years 2027 and 2028, $11 million for each of the years 2029 and 2030, and $3 million in total thereafter.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
